      {
        "@value": "[caption id=\"\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"940\"] Hannaford Street Silver Band, Christmas Cheer Concert[/caption]\r\n\r\nThe Holiday Season hits full stride with the incomparable Ben Heppner in a glorious evening of warmth, song and seasonal celebration. Join us at the marvellous Metropolitan United for an inspiring respite from the season and bathe in the glorious sounds of choir and brass."
