    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "SARNIA CONCERT ASSOCIATION PRESENTS ELMER ISELER SINGERS\r\nRETURN OF THE MONSTER CHOIR\r\nConductor/Artistic Director : Lydia Adams\r\n\r\nJoin us for the return of the renowned Elmer Iseler Singers. You will be astounded by the choir's magnificent presentation of music that spans 500 years.\r\n\r\n\"...Their voices were divine ...\" The Globe and Mail\r\n\r\nThis is part of the SCA 2018 - 2019 Subscription series. Single tickets on subject to availability at the Imperial Theatre website."
