    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The 5th stop on the Elmer Iseler Singers' 40th anniversary Ontario tour\r\nPresented by the Kincardine Community Singers\r\nThe Kincardine Community Singers are hosting and singing with the Elmer Iseler Singers in Kincardine, Ontario.\r\n\r\nTickets are $25/person and on sale on the Kincardine Community Singers' website and at the Harbour Rose Boutique (787 Queen Street, Kincardine)."
