    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "40th Anniversary Ontario Tour: Sault Sainte Marie"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The 2nd stop on the Elmer Iseler Singers' 40th anniversary Ontario tour\r\nPresented by Algoma Conservatory of Music\r\nFor one selection the Elmer Iseler Singers will be joined on the program by two excellent community choirs: The Algoma Festival Choir directed by Stephen Mallinger and the Chamber Singers of Algoma directed by Patty Gartshore. This massed choir is sure to produce a spectacular sound in the Machine Shop.\r\n\r\nTicket prices:\r\nAdults and Seniors: $35.\r\n35 Years and under $15.\r\n\r\nTickets available online at The Sault Community Theatre website, through the Station Mall Box Office or the Algoma Conservatory of Music by phone 705-253-4373 ext. 6400, email algomaconservatory@algomau.ca or Mail to: Algoma Conservatory of Music, 75 Huron Street, Sault Ste. Marie, ON, P6A 5P4"
      }
    ]
  },
