    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The 3rd stop on the Elmer Iseler Singers' 40th anniversary Ontario tour\r\nSponsor: Manitoulin Community Choir\r\nClick here for The Manitoulin Expositor interview of Jane Best, conductor of the Manitoulin Community Choir who, along with the Island Singers, are the hosting the Elmer Iseler Singers.\r\n\r\nTickets are $30 for adults and $20 for students and are available at the Recorder office, Manitoulin Expositor office, Central Pharmacy in Gore Bay and from members of the hosting choirs."
