      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The 4th stop on the Elmer Iseler Singers' 40th anniversary Ontario tour\r\nSponsor: Jim Dolmer\r\nGrace United will welcome the Elmer Iseler Singers in a concert performance conducted by artistic director Lydia Adams.\r\n\r\nTickets for the concert are $40 plus $1.50 handling.\r\n\r\nOnline ticket sales are now available. To purchase tickets please click the link below.\r\n\r\nTICKETS  \r\n\r\nTickets available through the Grace United Church website. For more information, email the Church Office or call (519)599-2438."
      }
