    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The 6th stop on the Elmer Iseler Singers' 40th anniversary Ontario tour\r\nThe Wiarton Concert Choir welcomes the Elmer Iseler Singers, the evening of March 29th.\r\nSince 1967, Wiarton Concert Choir has been producing big beautiful choral music in the picturesque small town of Wiarton, Ontario.\r\n\r\nTickets available at Josie's of Wiarton (618 Berford St). "
