    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "CANCELLED: Alberni Classical Concerts"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The Alberni Classical Concerts Committee was established in September 2016 with the goal of establishing an annual classical concert series in Port Alberni, with at least three concerts in a season that extends from October of one calendar year to May of the next. The purpose is to present live performances promoting Canadian professional musicians. Alberni Classical Concerts now present four concerts each season.\r\n\r\nThe Elmer Iseler Singers will be the 4th concert for the 2019-2020 Season.\r\n\r\nConcerts are held at the Arrowsmith Baptist Church, which has exceptional acoustics and provides a very comfortable environment.\r\n\r\nAdmission is by SERIES SUBSCRIPTION ONLY at $100.00 per person for all four concerts.\r\n\r\nTickets to individual concerts will not be sold, but subscriptions are transferrable.  Subscriptions are available at Rollin Art Centre (10% service charge) and from committee members (phone David Cox at 250-723-8362 or Colleen Goodrich at 250-723-5407). Rollin Art Centre accepts credit and debit cards. If paying by cheque, make cheques payable to Alberni Classical Concerts Society.\r\n\r\nSubscriptions will be available until October 13, 2019."
      }
    ]
  },
