        "@value": "Remembrance Day Civic Service"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Every Remembrance Day on November 11, we acknowledge the courage and sacrifice of those who served their country during times of war, military conflict and peace.\r\n\r\nAll are welcome to the City of Toronto services marking Remembrance Day at Old City Hall, the services are also live streamed on the City of Toronto YouTube channel."
