    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "A Gala Evening with the Elmer Isler Singers\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSave the date! Workshop, dinner, concert. More information available at westminster@westminsterorangeville.ca.\r\n\r\nFor tickets to the concert, please contact the office (secretary, Mrs. Sheedy) at the church, 247 Broadway, telephone 519-941-0381.\r\n\r\nView a recent interview of Lydia Adams by By Constance Scrafield in the Orangeville Citizen that highlights this workshop and concert.\r\n\r\nConcert Tickets:  Adults $40, Students $25\r\nWorkshop/Concert:  $50\r\n\r\nAll proceeds from this event will support the Westminster Capital Campaign to raise funds for the current Lower Level Renovation which includes a newly renovated auditorium, commercial kitchen, fully-accessible office space, new chapel/meeting space for intimate prayer, gatherings and smaller weddings, and a fully-accessible washroom facility off of the sanctuary space."
      }
    ]
  },
