    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Choral Fest, Niagara On The Lake"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Juno award-winning, internationally acclaimed choir, the Elmer Iseler Singers, with Lydia Adams at the helm, is back with a new and diverse repertoire that captures the joyful exuberance of the choir. They remind us that “some emotions are too powerful to be spoken so must be sung”. Don’t miss what promises to be an electrifying concert featuring works by Guerrero, Lassus, Gibbons, as well as Canadian composers R. M. Schafer, C. Vivier and H. Janmohamed. This is a not-to-be-missed and sure-to-sell-out performance!\r\n\r\nTickets starting from $45. Tickets available on the shawfest.com website.\r\n\r\nFurther details on the this Biennial Choral Festival performance is available on the Music Niagara website.\r\n\r\nFunded by Niagara Investment in Culture​​​​​"
      }
    ]
  },
