    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Atikokan Entertainment Series Presents: The Elmer Iseler Singers\r\n\r\n\r\nYou loved them when they last performed in Atikokan and we’re confident that you will be even more awestruck with their current sound.  An evening with this outstanding choral group simply can’t be missed!\r\n\r\n\r\nIndividual tickets and subscriptions available at the door or at Canoe Canada, 300 O'Brien St, Atikokan."
