    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The  Dryden Entertainment Series present the Elmer Iseler Singers!\r\n\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nTickets cost $34.00 and are available at: https://www.showclix.com/event/des-presents-elmer-iseler-singers\r\n\r\nContact the Dryden Entertainment Series by Email or visit the Event website or The Centre website for more information.\r\n\r\nGold Sponsor: Egli’s Sheep Farm and Animal Park\r\n\r\nSilver Sponsor: Bruce H O Cook Medicine Professional Corporation\r\n\r\nReception Courtesy of: Edward Jones – Janet Schaffer"
