    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The Red Lake Wilderness Entertainment Series present the Elmer Iseler Singers!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nRed Lake Wilderness Entertainment Series is a not-for-profit organization dedicated to bringing live entertainment to the Red Lake District of Northwestern Ontario.\r\nTickets\r\nIndividual tickets are $25 each. There will also be $5 tickets at the door for children 12 and under and students.\r\n\r\nOther ticket options include a 5 Show Flex Pass at $100 (All prices include HST).\r\n\r\nTickets are available at the door, online on the Red Lakes Wilderness Entertainment Series website , or locally at The Water Buffalo on Highway 105 in Red Lake."
