        "@value": "TrypTych Concert and Opera is pleased to work in association with The Lake of the Woods Concert Group in presenting the brilliant Elmer Iseler Singers in Concert.\r\n\r\nTrypTych has been organizing local choirs to have the great opportunity to work with Lydia Adams and the choir in workshop before the concert. Then they all get to join forces with the EIS and sing two numbers at the end of the program under the direction of Lenard Whiting. Can't wait! Ave Verum Corpus and Song for Canada. Let's do it!\r\n\r\nThe Lake of the Woods Concert Group has been offering a professional series of concerts to the City of Kenora and surrounding area for over 40 years. They endeavour to provide a varied selection of artists to appeal to a cross section of concertgoers.\r\nTickets\r\nRegular $25, Students $10\r\n\r\nTickets can be purchased at:\r\n\r\n \tJohnson's Pharmacy\r\n \tHo Jo's Coffee and Books"
      }
    ]
  },
