        "@value": "The Elmer lseler Singers present music which inspires and brings people together in a shared appreciation of beautiful vocal sound. Led by artistic director, Lydia Adams, she is an ambassador of the Canadian Music Centre and hailed by the CMC as “The new leading exponent of the Canadian choral composer”.\r\n\r\nSPONSORED BY Annabel Kennedy and Mario Ferrara\r\n\r\nFor more information or to purchase tickets visit the Music Niagara website. Tickets start at $40 per person.\r\n\r\nClick here for a copy of the Music Niagara Festival 2022 brochure.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: MASKS ARE REQUIRED AT ALL PERFORMANCES HELD AT ST. MARK’S CHURCH. "
      }
    ]
  },
