        "@id": "_:g1754380"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.elmeriselersingers.com/events/grace-united-church-concert/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Grace United Church concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Grace United Church Thornbury presents The Elmer Iseler Singers in concert for one evening.\r\nLydia Adams Artistic Director of the Elmer Iseler Singers will lead community choral enthusiasts in two works: “We Rise Again” by Leon Dubinsky and arranged by Lydia Adams, and “Wie Lieblich sind deine Wohnungen” from Brahms’ Eine Deutsche Requiem. Together, Grace United Church community choral enthusiasts will perform both works with the Elmer Iseler Singers in the evening concert.\r\n\r\nTickets for the Elmer Iseler Singers are on sale from the Grace United Church Admin Office at 519-599-2438 or graceucworship@gmail.com, or on eventbrite.ca\r\n\r\nThe Elmer Iseler Singers will be hosting a a vocal workshop at 4:30pm, to study music provided in advance and performed at the evening concert. For participants of the workshop a Light Supper is available in the short break before the concert.\r\n\r\nJoin The Elmer Iseler Singers live in the Sanctuary or live-streamed on video, shown in the Lower Hall on October 29th at 7:30pm.\r\n\r\nFor further details visit the Grace United Church website event page, or the Eventbrite page.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;"
      }
    ]
  },
