      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The Brantford Music Club (BMC) hosts a series of four concerts each year - three featuring high quality, professional Canadian Artists and one highlighting young, local musicians performing at a high level. The series features a variety of instrumentalists and vocalists with the music leaning toward the classical. The club has engaged musicians, early in their careers as well as those who have already established international reputations.\r\n\r\nDuring its 100 years, the Brantford Music Club has developed an outstanding reputation throughout the musical community.\r\n\r\nFor more information about the BMC 2022-23 season, visit https://brantfordmusicclub.ca/2022.htm\r\n\r\nTickets: Adult $40, Student $10 are available at tickets.sandersoncentre.ca"
      }
