    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Elmer Iseler Singers are joined by the Festival Ensemble and Jodi Contin, voice and drum\r\n\r\nMusic filled with joy! Music includes:\r\n\r\nELEANOR DALEY: Paradise\r\nLEONARD COHEN: Hallelujah\r\nJODI CONTIN: Song of Celebration\r\nMATTHEW EMERY: Barren Cabin, Tin Roof\r\n\r\nClick here for the full festival brochure.\r\n\r\nClick here to purchase tickets online."
