    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Festival of the Sound with Gino Quilico"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Elmer Iseler Singers At 45 with Baritone Gino Quilico\r\nEvery concert with the Elmer Iseler Singers is special and we welcome these treasured friends back as they celebrate their 45th year.\r\n\r\nThis joyous evening includes music by Leonard Bernstein, Michel Legrand, Franz Schubert and Tommy Dorsey. The legendary baritone, Gino Quilico, will sing favourite arias, including “Toreador” from Carmen and, of course, “O Sole Mio.”\r\n\r\nClick here for the festival website.\r\n\r\nClick here to purchase tickets online.\r\n\r\nAbout the Performance\r\nElmer Iseler Singers\r\n\r\nLydia Adams, conductor\r\n\r\nGino Quilico, baritone"
      }
    ]
  },
