    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Festival of the Sound with the Elora Singers"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Elmer Iseler Singers are joined by the Elora Singers.\r\n\r\nFor 45 years, the Elmer Iseler Singers, Elora Festival and Festival of the Sound have championed great music. This once-a-generation performance of Carl Orff's iconic Carmina Burana is not to be missed.\r\n\r\nClick here for the festival website.\r\n\r\nClick here to purchase tickets online.\r\nAbout the Performance\r\nElmer Iseler Singers, with Lydia Adams, Conductor\r\n\r\nElora Singers,  with Mark Vuorinen, Conductor\r\n\r\nAnagnoson &amp; Kinton Piano Duo\r\n\r\nLeslie Fagan - soprano\r\n\r\nAndrew Haji - tenor\r\n\r\nRussell Braun - baritone\r\n\r\nBeverley Johnston and the Festival Percussion Ensemble"
      }
    ]
  },
