    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Orillia Concert Association concert"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "The Orillia Concert Association present The Elmer Iseler Singers, under the masterful direction of Conductor and Artistic Director Lydia Adams. Created and established by the great Canadian choral master Elmer Iseler in 1979, this inspirational, innovative and passionate chamber choir verges on the sublime. Truly a heavenly experience where even angels are envious.\r\n\r\nClick here for ticket and subscription information available from The Orillia Concert Association.\r\n\r\nNow in its 76th year, the Orillia Concert Association has presented beautiful, fine music that has enriched and inspired musical audiences in Orillia.\r\n\r\nIn its inception as the Community Concert Association in 1947, they were the premiere outlet for fine music in Orillia. Today, alongside a number of arts presenters, they continue that tradition by providing exceptional musical entertainment from Canada and around the world as part of the rich cultural mosaic within the city."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
