      {
        "@value": "Celebrating Eleanor Daley &#8211; Festival of the Sound"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Parry Sound-born Eleanor Daley’s choral works have touched thousands of hearts around the world. The Elmer Isler Singers and Festival of the Sound celebrate and give thanks for the honour she has brought to Parry Sound and Canada. A night not to be missed!\r\n\r\nClick here for the Festival of the Sound event page.\r\n\r\nClick here for tickets."
