    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Presented by the Barrie Concert Association as part of their 2025-2026 concert season.\r\n\r\nSubscriptions for the Barrie Concert Association 2025-2026 season are available (and are an excellent value, with per concert prices about 40% lower than single ticket prices).\r\n\r\nSubscription tickets can be ordered and paid for online or by cheque.\r\n\r\nClick here to order subscriptions online\r\n\r\nOR you can e-transfer via your own secure banking app to: payments@barrieconcerts.org\r\n\r\n*Note: Be sure to let them know how many adult and student tickets you are purchasing.\r\n\r\nClick here for single tickets for this concert."
