        "@value": "Choir Camp presents a new Workshop and Concert Series, starting this fall with the Elmer Iseler Singers on Saturday, October 4.\r\n\r\nConductor Lydia Adams will lead workshops in the afternoon for all interested singers and musicians, rehearsing two or three pieces of music for all workshop participants to perform with the Elmer Iseler Singers at their evening concert.\r\n\r\nThe workshops and concert will take place at St. Andrew’s Presbyterian Church, 865 2nd Ave W in Owen Sound.\r\n\r\nThe registration fee includes participation in the afternoon workshops and one ticket to the evening concert. The registration fee is $100 for adults (ages 25 and up) and $50 for students (ages 14-24). For those not participating in the afternoon workshops, concert tickets will be $25.\r\n\r\nRegistration is open and you can sign up using the Choir Camp online registration form. More details coming soon!"
