    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Distant Worlds: Music from Final Fantasy"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "DISTANT WORLDS: MUSIC FROM FINAL FANTASY CELEBRATING FINAL FANTASY XIV AND XVI\r\nOntario Philharmonic present a special concert with music from FINAL FANTASY XIV, FINAL FANTASY XVI, and the entire FINAL FANTASY series, with HD video created by Square Enix just for this tour • Arnie Roth leads the Ontario Philharmonic and Elmer Iseler Singers performing classic works by Nobuo Uematsu, Masashi Hamauzu, Masayoshi Soken, Yoko Shimomura, and other great FINAL FANTASY composers from throughout the FINAL FANTASY series, with a performance from FINAL FANTASY XIV and XVI original vocalist Amanda Achen, and FINAL FANTASY XVI composer Masayoshi Soken in attendance\r\n• Don’t miss out on this multimedia concert experience!  More Details\r\n\r\nSPECIAL CONCERT •  FINAL FANTASY SERIES\r\nWorks by Nobuo Uematsu, Masashi Hamauzu, Masayoshi Soken, Yoko Shimomura\r\n• Amanda Achen, vocal soloist\r\n• ONTARIO PHILHARMONIC with Elmer Iseler Singers, chorus\r\n\r\n\r\nClick here for individual tickets"
      }
    ]
  },
