      {
        "@value": "Join us at our Annual Springtime Celebration for this special ONLINE presentation as we enjoy many stories and talents of Lydia Adams, the Elmer Iseler Singers and our special guest, songwriter Allister MacGillivray, who wrote the famous 'Song for the Mira'."
