    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Lydia Adams conducts Elmer Iseler Singers in concert online on Sunday, May 29th 2022 at 4 p.m. - Songs of Light - Presenting a significant choral/cultural spectrum of interest and understanding through compositions by Canadian and International composers."
